    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Job Application Screening (Week 03 / HW 02)\nForm Trigger -> Config -> Compose Resume Text -> Information Extractor -> Evaluate Candidate -> Is Qualified?\ntrue: Score Candidate (Basic LLM Chain) -> Prepare Sheet Row -> Append to Google Sheet -> Qualified Candidates Output\nfalse: Unqualified Candidates\n\n**Coverage**\n- R1 Form Trigger (text, email, dropdown, radio, date, number, checkbox, textarea, file)\n- R2 Information Extractor (+ OpenRouter Chat Model Extractor): name, email, phone, yearsOfExperience, skills\n- R3 Config (minYears, minSkillCategories, skillCategories) + Evaluate Candidate\n- R4 Is Qualified? (IF) + Unqualified Candidates\n- R5 Qualified Candidates Output\n- R6 Append to Google Sheet (bonus)\n- R7 Score Candidate: Basic LLM Chain + Structured Output Parser (bonus)\n\nSetup: connect OpenRouter and Google Sheets credentials; pick the spreadsheet in Append to Google Sheet (header row = columns of Prepare Sheet Row). Test: open the Form Trigger test URL.",
        "height": 440,
        "width": 720
      },
